# Canonical, hand-authored DDL lives in this directory as ordered NNNN_*.sql files
# (the source of truth applied by src/db/migrate.ts). drizzle-kit diff-inspection
# output (pnpm db:generate) is written to ./_generated, never here, so it cannot be
# mistaken for or applied alongside the canonical migrations. Kept tracked so the
# directory exists even before any SQL is added.
